[
  {"id":"pvz-tow-001","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_1","category":"feeding","minHeight":2,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"谢谢这袋肥料。我会边长高，边分享游戏小知识。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-002","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_2","category":"feeding","minHeight":3,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"坚果挡住僵尸时，后面的食人花就有机会吞掉它。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-003","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_3","category":"feeding","minHeight":4,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"阳光不够用？先试试种两列向日葵。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-004","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_4","category":"feeding","minHeight":5,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"把坚果放在睡莲上，可以拦住潜水僵尸。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-005","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_5","category":"feeding","minHeight":6,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版游戏里输入 future，僵尸就会戴上未来风格的眼镜。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-006","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_6","category":"feeding","minHeight":7,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"普通巨人僵尸需要承受两次樱桃炸弹的伤害。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-007","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_7","category":"feeding","minHeight":8,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"想收集禅境花园的蘑菇，去夜间关卡碰碰运气。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-008","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_8","category":"feeding","minHeight":9,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"毁灭菇留下的坑会慢慢恢复，不会永久占着土地。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-009","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_9","category":"feeding","minHeight":10,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版主菜单里的小花也能点击，试试它们的反应。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-010","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_10","category":"feeding","minHeight":11,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"减速后的僵尸，连啃植物的动作也会变慢。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-011","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_11","category":"feeding","minHeight":12,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"寻找雪人僵尸时，记得留意黑暗的夜间关卡。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-012","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_12","category":"feeding","minHeight":13,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"小喷菇不花阳光，是夜间开局的好帮手。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-013","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_13","category":"feeding","minHeight":14,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"水生植物的花园幼苗，可以在泳池关卡里寻找。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-014","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_14","category":"feeding","minHeight":15,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"有些巨人僵尸挥舞的武器，竟然是另一只僵尸。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-015","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_15","category":"feeding","minHeight":16,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"给蜗牛喂巧克力，它会勤快地收集硬币一个小时。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-016","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_16","category":"feeding","minHeight":17,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"生存无尽会掉落各种花园植物，并不限于水生植物。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-017","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_17","category":"feeding","minHeight":18,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"巧克力在各种游戏模式里都有机会掉落。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-018","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_18","category":"feeding","minHeight":19,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"选植物前先看草坪预览，有墓碑再带墓碑吞噬者。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-019","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_19","category":"feeding","minHeight":20,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"铁桶僵尸大约能承受普通僵尸五倍的打击。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-020","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_20","category":"feeding","minHeight":21,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版输入 mustache，可以给僵尸添上胡子。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-021","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_21","category":"feeding","minHeight":22,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"多颗寒冰豌豆命中同一僵尸，不会让减速继续叠加。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-022","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_22","category":"feeding","minHeight":23,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"夜间生存先清理墓碑，能减少从墓碑里钻出的僵尸。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-023","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_23","category":"feeding","minHeight":24,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"看看关卡进度条上有几面旗，就知道要迎接多少大波。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-024","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_24","category":"feeding","minHeight":25,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"挑战跳跳舞会时，屋顶清洁车能多给你一次防线。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-025","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_25","category":"feeding","minHeight":26,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"魅惑舞王僵尸后，它召来的伴舞也会帮助你。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-026","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_26","category":"feeding","minHeight":27,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"想攒游戏金币，可以挑战生存无尽。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-027","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_27","category":"feeding","minHeight":28,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"寒冰豌豆穿过火炬树桩会被解冻，失去冰冻效果。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-028","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_28","category":"feeding","minHeight":29,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"植物僵尸发射的豌豆，可以用坚果挡下来。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-029","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_29","category":"feeding","minHeight":30,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"跳跳舞会和雪橇区难应付时，带上倭瓜试试。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-030","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_30","category":"feeding","minHeight":31,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"火爆辣椒不光烧僵尸，还能清除冰车留下的冰道。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-031","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_31","category":"feeding","minHeight":32,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"买到模仿者后，点图鉴左上角的小图标就能查看它。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-032","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_32","category":"feeding","minHeight":33,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"坚果保龄球里，一颗坚果连续弹中得越多，金币也越多。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-033","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_33","category":"feeding","minHeight":34,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版水族馆和僵尸水族馆里，右键会敲一敲玻璃。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-034","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_34","category":"feeding","minHeight":35,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"砸罐子时，从右侧开始通常更容易掌握局面。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-035","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_35","category":"feeding","minHeight":36,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"我是僵尸里的舞王虽然贵，选对位置就能发挥价值。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-036","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_36","category":"feeding","minHeight":37,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"猫尾草的尖刺可以扎破气球，让气球僵尸落地。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-037","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_37","category":"feeding","minHeight":38,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"要养水生植物，先为花园添置水族馆。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-038","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_38","category":"feeding","minHeight":39,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"磁力菇能吸走矿工僵尸的镐子，让它无法继续挖地。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-039","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_39","category":"feeding","minHeight":40,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"疯狂戴夫商店的金盏花每天会更新。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-040","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_40","category":"feeding","minHeight":41,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"蘑菇园是照料花园蘑菇的地方。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-041","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_41","category":"feeding","minHeight":42,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"高坚果上的梯子，可以让磁力菇吸走。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-042","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_42","category":"feeding","minHeight":43,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"高坚果能拦住海豚骑士和跳跳僵尸的跳跃。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-043","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_43","category":"feeding","minHeight":44,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"樱桃炸弹和火爆辣椒也能移除坚果上的梯子。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-044","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_44","category":"feeding","minHeight":45,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"巧克力除了喂蜗牛，也能让禅境花园里的植物更有活力。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-045","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_45","category":"feeding","minHeight":46,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"火焰豌豆的加成会受到冰车、铁门、梯子和投石车的抵抗。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-046","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_46","category":"feeding","minHeight":47,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"生存无尽里，同一种升级植物种得越多，后续价格越高。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-047","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_47","category":"feeding","minHeight":48,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"我是僵尸残局没有植物阻拦时，小鬼僵尸能快速拿走脑子。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-048","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_48","category":"feeding","minHeight":49,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"在原版输入 trickedout，可以改变割草机的外观。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-049","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_49","category":"feeding-repeat","minHeight":50,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"我先整理一下学到的东西。根扎得稳，枝叶才有地方去。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-101","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_101","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"泥土刚刚松开一点，我的根就找到了一条新路。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-102","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_102","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"风穿过树冠，我又记住了一种声音。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-103","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_103","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"你忙你的，我会把这片绿荫慢慢养大。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-104","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_104","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"看不见的地方也有进步，比如又长长了一点的树根。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-105","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_105","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"你走了很多路，我也往天空伸出了新的一寸。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-106","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_106","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"对树来说，一圈年轮就是一页日历。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-107","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_107","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"留一片叶子给明天，留一点耐心给自己。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-108","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_108","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"雨水在根和叶之间旅行，我负责给它指路。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-109","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_109","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"安静一会儿，也许就能发现刚才没看见的嫩芽。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-110","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_110","category":"idle","minHeight":2,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"天气凉下来时，我会把下一次春天藏进枝条。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-201","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_201","category":"idle-young","minHeight":2,"maxHeight":11,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"今天的阳光很足，新叶子有了新的计划。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-202","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_202","category":"idle-young","minHeight":2,"maxHeight":11,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"一片小叶子，也能给花园添上一点清新。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-203","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_203","category":"idle-young","minHeight":2,"maxHeight":11,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"新叶子展开的时候，我想给它取一个名字。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-204","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_204","category":"idle-young","minHeight":2,"maxHeight":11,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"我的目标很简单：今天比昨天离天空近一点。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-205","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_205","category":"idle-young","minHeight":2,"maxHeight":11,"originalReachability":"present-in-strings-not-selected-by-reviewed-babble-code","textKind":"original-chat","text":"我还很小，正好有许多东西可以慢慢学。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-301","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_301","category":"idle-grown","minHeight":12,"maxHeight":49,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"每次被认真照料，我都会多长出一点底气。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-302","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_302","category":"idle-grown","minHeight":12,"maxHeight":49,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"一滴水很小，许多滴水就能把整个花园唤醒。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-303","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_303","category":"idle-grown","minHeight":12,"maxHeight":49,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"远处也有树。我们隔着风，交换季节的消息。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-304","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_304","category":"idle-grown","minHeight":12,"maxHeight":49,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"你带来的问题，会在我的枝叶间停留一会儿。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-305","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_305","category":"idle-grown","minHeight":12,"maxHeight":49,"originalReachability":"present-in-strings-not-selected-by-reviewed-babble-code","textKind":"original-chat","text":"换个位置看看影子，有时就能换个角度想事情。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-401","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_401","category":"idle-tall","minHeight":50,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"枝干变粗以后，我能接住更多风，也能留住更多鸟鸣。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-402","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_402","category":"idle-tall","minHeight":50,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"一片森林的热闹，是每棵树一点点贡献出来的。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-403","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_403","category":"idle-tall","minHeight":50,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"旧叶子落下，新叶子长出，花园总有新的故事。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-404","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_404","category":"idle-tall","minHeight":50,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"不用一次想明白一切，先照顾好眼前这一片叶子。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-405","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_405","category":"idle-tall","minHeight":50,"originalReachability":"present-in-strings-not-selected-by-reviewed-babble-code","textKind":"original-chat","text":"愿意天天照料的小事，最后会长成让人惊讶的大树。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-500","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_500","category":"repeat-intro","minHeight":5,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"再翻一页小知识吧，也许这次刚好用得上。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-600","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_600","category":"first-feed-prompt","minHeight":1,"maxHeight":1,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"我已经准备好了。给这棵小树一袋肥料，让它开始长高吧。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-800","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_800","category":"milestone","minHeight":100,"milestoneHeight":100,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版智慧树长到 100 英尺后，daisies 可以让倒下的僵尸留下雏菊。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-900","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_900","category":"milestone","minHeight":500,"milestoneHeight":500,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版智慧树长到 500 英尺后，dance 可以让僵尸跳舞。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-1000","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_1000","category":"milestone","minHeight":1000,"milestoneHeight":1000,"textKind":"gameplay-summary","text":"原版智慧树长到 1000 英尺后，pinata 可以让被消灭的僵尸散落糖果。"},
  {"id":"pvz-tow-1100","sourceKey":"TREE_OF_WISDOM_1100","category":"feeding-final","minHeight":1001,"textKind":"original-chat","text":"这本小知识已经翻完了，花园的故事还可以接着长。"}
]
